# ==============================================================================
# SafeVault AI — Environment Configuration Template
# ==============================================================================
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your environment-specific credentials.
# NEVER commit sensitive API keys or service role secrets into source control.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Supabase Configuration (Required for Database, Auth & Storage)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Obtain these from your Supabase Dashboard -> Project Settings -> API


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. OpenRouter AI (Recommended for 100% Free AI Models)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Get your free API key at: https://openrouter.ai/settings/keys


# Choose any of the free OpenRouter models below (default: NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Super):
# - nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free      (Recommended: 262k ctx, fast reasoning & documents)
# - nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b:free       (1M ctx, highest reasoning capability)
# - poolside/laguna-s-2.1:free                  (262k ctx, strong coding & structured JSON)
# - nvidia/nemotron-3.5-lightning:free          (1M ctx, low latency)
# - dots-studio/dots-3-note-preview:free        (512k ctx, multimodal)
# - thinkingmachines/inkling:free               (1.05M ctx, multimodal)
# - cohere/north-mini-code:free                 (256k ctx)
# - liquid/lfm-2.5-2.6b:free                    (66k ctx, lightweight RAG)


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Alternative AI Providers (Optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If you prefer direct OpenAI or Lovable AI Gateway:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# LOVABLE_API_KEY=...

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. AWS KMS Production Envelope Encryption (Optional / Enterprise)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# When configured, production master key management is delegated to AWS KMS.
# If omitted, SafeVault operates in Zero-Knowledge Web Crypto mode (PBKDF2/AES-GCM).
# AWS_REGION=us-east-1
# AWS_KMS_KEY_ID=arn:aws:kms:us-east-1:123456789012:key/your-key-uuid
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=AKIA...
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=...
